T*
(delta = 1 / sqrt\( pi * f * mu_0 * sigma \) = 1 / sqrt\( pi * 25*10^6 * 4*pi*10^-7 * 4.0 \)) Tj
T*
(= 1 / sqrt\( 394.78 \) = 1 / 19.869 = 0.0503 m = 50.3 mm.) Tj
T*
