T*
(Attenuation in dB = 8.686 * alpha * x, where alpha = 1 / delta = 19.869 Np/m.) Tj
T*
(Attenuation rate = 8.686 * 19.869 = 172.58 dB/m.) Tj
T*
(For 40 dB drop: x = 40 / 172.58 = 0.2318 m = 23.2 cm.) Tj
T*
(Conclusion: Skin depth = 50.3 mm; EM power attenuates by 40 dB within just 23.2 cm,) Tj
T*
(explaining why radio communication cannot penetrate deep ocean waters.) Tj
